<h2><a id="Exemples" name="Exemples"></a>Examples</h2>

<p>In order to transform a complete directory to REL4=20:</p>

<pre>ConvREL 4 directory\*.*</pre>

<p>On the other hand, in order to transform a directory and all its subdirectories recursively:</p>

<pre>ConvREL 4 = directory\*.* /S</pre>

<p><a href="#MENU"><img src="back.jpg"/></a></p>
